{"seq":7,"slug":"community-shared-future","title":"人类命运共同体","stage":"DONE","category":"xi-jinping-thought","categoryLabel":"习近平思想","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/03_xi-jinping-thought/07_community-shared-future","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"人类命运共同体-简介\">人类命运共同体 简介</h1><p>人类命运共同体是习近平外交思想的核心理念，也是中国参与和引领全球治理体系变革的总纲性主张。本知识库定位于&quot;理念—实践—评价&quot;的闭环解读：既讲清这一理念&quot;是什么、为什么、怎么建&quot;，也如实呈现国际社会从积极接纳到尖锐质疑的多元反应，帮助读者建立既深入又批判的认识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>习近平思想系列下设多个 hub，命运共同体与其中几个相邻 hub 在主题上有交集但侧重不同。明确边界有助于按需取用、避免重复阅读：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>07 人类命运共同体（本 hub）</td>\n<td>中国如何看待并重塑全球秩序的总体理念</td>\n<td>提供外交与全球治理的顶层框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../belt-and-road-initiative/\">05 一带一路</a></td>\n<td>一项具体的国际合作倡议如何落地</td>\n<td>命运共同体最重要的实践平台，本 hub 引用其成效，不展开项目细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ecological-civilization/\">06 生态文明</a></td>\n<td>国内外生态治理的理论与制度</td>\n<td>&quot;清洁美丽&quot;支柱的理论来源，本 hub 只取其全球意涵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../new-development-philosophy/\">04 新发展理念</a></td>\n<td>国内经济发展的指导思想</td>\n<td>&quot;共同繁荣&quot;支柱的国内根基，本 hub 关注其对外延伸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../governance-of-china/\">02 治国理政</a></td>\n<td>习近平思想的文献体系与总体命题</td>\n<td>提供&quot;新型国际关系&quot;&quot;民族复兴&quot;等上位概念</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：本 hub 谈的是&quot;中国主张世界应当如何组织&quot;，05/06/04 谈的是&quot;中国自己在做什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>按读者背景与目标，建议三条路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>入门读者（建立全貌）</strong>：先读第一章 <a href=\"concept-framework/proposal-evolution\">理念提出与演变</a> 把握来龙去脉，再读 <a href=\"concept-framework/core-connotation\">核心内涵</a> 与 <a href=\"concept-framework/five-pillars\">五大支柱</a> 掌握理论骨架，即可形成整体印象。</li>\n<li><strong>实务/政策读者（关注落地）</strong>：在通读第一章后，重点研读第二章三篇——<a href=\"practice-platform/un-system-reform\">联合国体系改革</a>、<a href=\"practice-platform/south-south-cooperation\">南南合作</a>、<a href=\"practice-platform/global-governance\">全球治理</a>，理解从理念到机制的转化路径。</li>\n<li><strong>研究/批判性读者（评估争议）</strong>：先快速过一、二章建立背景，再以第三章 <a href=\"response-evaluation/international-reception\">国际反响</a>、<a href=\"response-evaluation/western-critique\">西方批评</a>、<a href=\"response-evaluation/developing-world-view\">发展中国家视角</a> 为重点，在多元评价中形成独立判断。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三章呈递进关系：第一章回答&quot;是什么&quot;，第二章回答&quot;怎么做&quot;，第三章回答&quot;效果与争议如何&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：对当代国际关系格局与联合国体系有基本了解；知道&quot;一带一路&quot;是什么。</li>\n<li><strong>有助益</strong>：国际关系基础理论（现实主义、自由主义、建构主义），可参阅政治学 hub 的 <a href=\"../../../political-science/international-relations/ir-theories/realism\">国际关系理论</a>；理念的思想渊源涉及马克思主义共同体构想，可参阅 <a href=\"../../../marxism/marxism-fundamentals/marxism-history/marxism-china\">马克思主义中国化</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>非必需</strong>：阅读本 hub 不要求经济学或环境科学背景，相关跨学科延伸已在各篇末尾&quot;延伸阅读&quot;中按需给出链接。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>阅读本 hub 时建议结合不同文明传统的全球治理理论进行对照，以拓展认识的深度与广度。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"concept-framework","title":"概念框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/concept-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"proposal-evolution","title":"人类命运共同体的提出与演变","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/concept-framework/proposal-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-connotation","title":"核心内涵","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/concept-framework/core-connotation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"five-pillars","title":"五大支柱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/concept-framework/five-pillars"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"practice-platform","title":"实践平台","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/practice-platform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"un-system-reform","title":"联合国体系改革","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/practice-platform/un-system-reform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"south-south-cooperation","title":"南南合作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/practice-platform/south-south-cooperation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-governance","title":"全球治理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/practice-platform/global-governance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"response-evaluation","title":"回应与评价","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/response-evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"international-reception","title":"国际反响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/response-evaluation/international-reception"},{"seq":2,"slug":"western-critique","title":"西方批评","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/response-evaluation/western-critique"},{"seq":3,"slug":"developing-world-view","title":"发展中国家视角","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/community-shared-future/response-evaluation/developing-world-view"}]}]}